{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Frogdoku</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hop, think, and leap your way across peaceful waters.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Frogdoku</i> is a 3D grid-based puzzle game where logic, planning, and spatial awareness are key. As Konna, a clever frog, your mission is to arrange lily pads into a viable path, then leap across them to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge logic with rhythm as you arrange lily pads into harmonious patterns that unlock your path. With stylized visuals, ambient sound, and fluid movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles start simple, but quickly evolve into intricate brain teasers where every move can lead to victory, or a splash! Inspired by the elegance of Sudoku and the movement logic of block puzzles, <i>Frogdoku</i> offers a rewarding challenge for puzzle enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc38 Rearrange lily pads to solve grid-based puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3c A gentle difficulty curve that grows into serious challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f 3D stylized environments that mimic the coziness of 2D illustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Relaxing music and soundscapes from peaceful wetlands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Minimalist UI and serene visuals for a calm experience</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720260?t=1771598624","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720260?t=1771598624","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a